    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I<br />\t\t\tEnzyme</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II<br />\t\t\tConversion of</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td>Invertase</td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td>Starch into maltose</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td>Zymase</td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td>Maltose into glucose</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.</td>\t\t\t<td>Diastase</td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td>Glucose into ethanol</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.</td>\t\t\t<td>Maltase</td>\t\t\t<td>IV.</td>\t\t\t<td>Cane sugar into glucose</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below</p>",
