  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Invertase helps in the conversion of sucrose to glucose and fructose.</p><p>Zymase&nbsp;catalyses the conversion of glucose or fructose to ethyl alcohol.</p><p>Diastase is a starch hydrolysing enzyme that&nbsp;breaks down the complex carbohydrate (polysaccharides, i.e. starch) into simple carbohydrates (monosaccharides, i.e. simple sugar like glucose).</p><p>Maltase catalyses the conversion of maltose to glucose.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
